Subject: [PATCH] sources: discard unavailable preference dialogs before
 binding restored views

AndroidX can restore a source preference dialog before its extension screen contains the target preference. Remove the stale dialog before STARTED and preserve dialogs whose preference is present. Shared with mihon-harmony 0107.
